    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The Corporation comprises of a Board of Advisorsnot more than five clergymen and laymen, Board of Trusteescomprising of the Chairman, three Vice Chairman Secretaryand Treasurer, a Board of Officials comprising of Chairman,three Vice-Chairmen, Secretary, Assistant Secretary,Treasurer, Inspector, General Manager, and Secretary of thereligions division, and in addition to the Board of Officials,a General Committee comprising of fifteen officers and theGeneral Assembly.",
